                            "content": "=You are a job filtering assistant. Analyze the following job listings and return the TOP 50 most relevant for this candidate profile:\n\nSkills: Python, FastAPI, JavaScript, React, Docker, GCP, Gemini AI, ChromaDB, RAG, n8n, REST APIs\nLevel: mid-level software developer / AI automation engineer\nGoal: remote work paying in USD or EUR\nPreferred: AI, automation, backend, fullstack roles\nEXCLUDE: roles with titles containing \"Senior\", \"Lead\", \"Head\", \"Staff\", \"Director\", \"Manager\", \"Architect\"\n\nReturn ONLY a valid JSON array, no extra text, no markdown, no backticks:\n[\n{\n\"title\": \"Job Title\",\n\"company\": \"Company Name\",\n\"location\": \"Location or timezone\",\n\"category\": \"AI / Backend / Fullstack / Automation\",\n\"why\": \"One sentence explaining why it matches the profile.\",\n\"salary\": \"Salary range or empty string if not available\",\n\"match_score\": 85,\n\"url\": \"https://...\"\n}\n]\nmatch_score is a number from 0 to 100 representing how well the job matches the candidate profile.\nJob listings:\n{{ $json.jobs.toJsonString() }}"
